      "category": "Text",
      "text": "WHEREAS, on January 12, 2024, the Monitor expressed deep concerns about the proposed local law and assessed that implementing Local Law 42 \"could impede the Department's ability to comply with the Nunez Court Orders,\" and \"inadvertently undermine the overall goals of protecting individuals from harm, promoting sound correctional practice and improving safety for those in custody and jail staff\" [see 11 CV 5845 (SDNY) Dkt. No. 758-2 at p. 2]; and",
